
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">I&#8217;ve made no mystery of the fact that I think the way we interact with productivity apps is changing. I was happy to see my favorite mind mapping app, MindNode, get MCP support today.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">It&#8217;s Mac-only and well done, giving the user read-only or write access, and it gives you plenty of ways to interact with your mind map. I&#8217;ve started experimenting with having my AI output strategy ideas and decision trees to my node, and I think there&#8217;s really a place for this. You can learn more <a href="https://www.mindnode.com/blog/2026.5">from MindNode directly</a>.</p>



